  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 4 - Notwithstanding the provisions of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development Order) 1995 (or any order revoking or re-enacting that order) no enlargement of the premises hereby approved or any additional structures/buildings within the curtilage of the site shall be carried out.",
    "Condition : 5 - No demolition or construction work shall take place on the site except between the hours of  08.00 to 18.00  on Mondays to Friday and 08.00 to 18.00.  on Saturdays and none shall take place on Sundays and Public Holidays without the prior agreement of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 6 - No additional flank windows or other glazed openings shall be formed in the rear wall or flank wall of the house hereby approved without the prior written consent of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 7 - No development shall take place until details of an amended parking layout, indicating a maximum of one off-street space for the house hereby approved and the relocation of the proposed crossover, clear of the existing speed hump, has been submitted and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority."
  ],
